    {
        "id": "note-theme",
        "type": "ui-markdown",
        "z": "yonder-console",
        "group": "group-appearance",
        "order": 1,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 2,
        "name": "what changing this costs",
        "content": "**Day is the chart and night is the display.** Two modes for two conditions, not one at two brightnesses — in direct sunlight a dark screen is a mirror, so day is a light page; after dusk a light page destroys dark adaptation, so night is the glass display in its panel.\n\nThe layout is identical between them. Nothing moves, nothing is renamed, no instrument appears or disappears — only the material changes.\n\nChanging it is a configuration change like any other. It is applied straight away and it reverts by itself unless you confirm it on the Network page. The console is not restarted, so you stay signed in — refresh the page to see it.",
        "className": "",
        "x": 200,
        "y": 380,
        "wires": []
    },
